WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:21.881
Eddy was on the bridge.

2
00:00:21.882 --> 00:00:26.336
"This bridge isn't scary," he thought.

3
00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:30.030
Some birds flew by.

4
00:00:30.031 --> 00:00:34.209
"Birds aren't scary," Eddy thought.

5
00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:37.714
A wind blew.

6
00:00:37.715 --> 00:00:41.617
"Wind isn't scary," Eddy thought.

7
00:00:41.618 --> 00:00:46.680
Then a stronger wind blew.

8
00:00:46.681 --> 00:00:49.379
The bridge shook!

9
00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:53.163
"Ahh!" Eddy screamed.

10
00:00:53.164 --> 00:00:55.725
He spun his tires.

11
00:00:55.726 --> 00:01:06.633
And he shot across the bridge!

12
00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:12.055
Eddy stopped on the other side.

13
00:01:12.056 --> 00:01:15.633
"Whew!" said Eddy.

14
00:01:15.634 --> 00:01:17.754
"I'm safe!"

15
00:01:17.755 --> 00:01:25.407
Eddy looked back.

16
00:01:25.408 --> 00:01:28.834
Poppy drove onto the bridge.

17
00:01:28.835 --> 00:01:35.316
Everyone else followed Poppy.

18
00:01:35.317 --> 00:01:39.643
Soon everyone was on Eddy's side.

19
00:01:39.644 --> 00:01:44.419
"Thanks, Eddy," said Poppy.

20
00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:48.304
"You were very brave.

21
00:01:48.305 --> 00:01:53.107
You made us brave!"

22
00:01:53.108 --> 00:01:57.310
"Well done, Eddy," said Ms. Fender.

23
00:01:57.311 --> 00:02:01.666
Eddy grinned.
